  "_corrections": [
    "2026-06-22 ARG v AUT was recorded 1-0; actual 2-0. 2026-06-22 JOR v ALG was recorded 2-1 to Jordan; actual 1-2 to Algeria. Both were wrong: with them, Group J could not be reconciled against standings.json (Algeria needed +4 pts from one game, Jordan -3). Corrected per Wikipedia's Group J match list -- after which the group balances exactly AND independently yields the ALG 3-3 AUT matchday-3 result the same source reports. Both are flagged `corrected` and show a tag on the page.",
    "knockouts.json records 'ARG 3-2 CPV (aet)' as a ROUND OF 16 result and lists CPV among the teams that reached the R16. That game was actually the ROUND OF 32 tie on Jul 3 (ESPN, CNN, FIFA, Wikipedia). Cape Verde lost it and never reached the R16; EGYPT did, beating Australia 4-2 on pens in the R32, then losing 3-2 to Argentina in the R16 on Jul 7. matches.json reflects the true rounds. knockouts.json is NOT changed here -- fixing it changes league scoring, which is a separate call."
  ]
